menu "Distap device"

    config DISTAP_RAW_CAPTURE_ONLY
        bool "Build raw-capture-only test firmware (no pump decoders)"
        default n
        help
            Builds a smaller test-only firmware that only supports the
            generic raw-capture display types (90+, see device.h) used to
            reverse-engineer unknown pumps. Excludes all real pump decoder
            components (censtar, hongyang, longfeng, sanki, wayn) to shrink
            flash usage. Pair with sdkconfig.raw_capture.defaults, which
            also sets CONFIG_APP_PROJECT_VER to a 99.x.y.z marker so main
            can tell a raw-capture test board apart from a production one
            by its reported firmware version.

endmenu
